    "projection": "classical MDS + SMACOF, canonically oriented",
    "clustering": "average-linkage agglomerative on cosine distance, 2 levels",
    "cards": 100,
    "unresolved": [],
    "note": "Positions are LOCAL to this deck and are not atlas positions — the deck is re-laid-out from its own cards, which is the whole point. Anything that draws this must say so.",
    "named_by": "deck-cartographer",
    "cartographer_notes": [
      "CardBERT split the commanders: Shabraz sits in THE AIR FORCE (city-0) with the blue flyers, Brallin in THE TOLL COLLECTORS (city-2) with the red discard payoffs. That reads as a colour/theme split, not a job split; both commanders do the same job of getting paid off moved cards.",
      "city-3 has one neighbourhood with identical membership to the city, so it is left unnamed (renderer fallback) rather than given a synonym.",
      "city-1-hood-0 is mostly lands with basic land types (shocks, Triome, Island, Thundering Falls, Irrigated Farmland), but Mana Geyser, a ritual, sits in it. Geyser is the odd card in a land city, sitting next to lands only by theme.",
      "city-4-hood-0 is eight any-colour lands plus Sol Ring and Reliquary Tower; Sol Ring belongs in hood-1 with the other rocks by job, and Reliquary Tower is a hand-size card that does the same job as Library of Leng in city-6-hood-1.",
      "city-0-hood-1 mixes two draw multipliers (Rhystic Study, Teferi's Ageless Insight) with two token-makers (Drake Haven, Shark Typhoon); the shared job is 'more out of each card', which the name follows.",
      "city-2-hood-1 is loosely bound: discard pings (Glint-Horn Buccaneer, Magmakin Artillerist), an opponent-draw pinger (Razorkin Needlehead), a counter-grower (Marauding Mako) and attack-triggered cards (Anje's Ravager, Vanguard Suppressor). The split from hood-0 reads partly arbitrary.",
      "city-5 splits cleanly by colour: hood-0 is red (Burning Inquiry, Faithless Looting, Jeska's Will, Khorvath's Fury, Molten Psyche, Reforge the Soul, Winds of Change), hood-1 is blue (Commit // Memory, Echo of Eons, Time Reversal, Tolarian Winds, Windfall). Jeska's Will is not a wheel (it exiles and plays); it is there by colour and theme.",
      "city-3 holds Mask of Memory, a looting equipment, among the protection; by job it belongs with the churn cards. Its neighbours are the other equipment (Greaves, Boots).",
      "Verified-line cards: city-4-hood-1 is 3 of 3 verified (Arcane Signet, Smothering Tithe, Sticky Fingers); others are Windfall and Reforge the Soul (city-5), Library of Leng (city-6-hood-1), Rhystic Study and Rielle (city-0), Greaves and Boots (city-3)."
    ]
  },
